I studied the samples. The Faugn create a substance when they regain their senses, and it is sensitive to heat. If we burn it like incense, we can extract the substance. We need a censer to amplify the heat. But the tentacle is very tough, and common metal will not withstand the power.
Arteres brought a sword blade of the Insane Crios. It is made of a very rare metal. I think we can use it.

Please, bring a few more Sharp Blades.

[Challenge Objective]

Collect 3 Sharp Blades by hunting the Insane Crios in the Sanctuary of the Abyss.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
